  "title": "Imitation Crab Casserole with Cheese",
  "description": "Creamy, cheesy, and loaded with crab, this easy casserole is inexpensive to make thanks to condensed soup and imitation crab.",
  "authors": [
    "John"
  ],
  "date_published": "2015-04-18T11:10:31-04:00",
